msgid "Specify a circuit and observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Tukuyin ang isang circuit at observable {#specify-a-circuit-and-observable}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a mirror circuit of a Trotterized time evolution of a 1D Ising chain Hamiltonian on eight qubits. Mirror the circuit to cancel its unitary and form an identity circuit, so each observable's ideal expectation value is known to be 1 without the need to compute it. In addition, mirroring doubles the circuit depth, which in turn doubles the noise's effect.\n"
msgstr "Maghanda ng mirror circuit ng Trotterized na time evolution ng isang 1D Ising chain Hamiltonian sa walong qubit. I-mirror ang circuit para kanselahin ang unitary nito at bumuo ng identity circuit, kaya alam nang 1 ang ideal na expectation value ng bawat observable nang hindi na kailangang kalkulahin. Bukod dito, dinodoble ng mirroring ang circuit depth, na dinodoble rin ang epekto ng noise.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the angle $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{4}$ to make the dynamics non-Clifford.\n"
msgstr "Gamitin ang anggulong $\\theta= \\frac{\\pi}{4}$ para maging non-Clifford ang dynamics.\n"

