# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose desired bias bound based on shot overhead-bias trade-off {#choose-desired-bias-bound-based-on-shot-overhead-bias-trade-off}"
msgstr "Piliin ang nais na bias bound batay sa trade-off ng shot overhead at bias {#choose-desired-bias-bound-based-on-shot-overhead-bias-trade-off}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this guide we choose a bias tolerance of 5%. Note that this bias calculation is based on the learned noise model, which might not be perfectly aligned with the real noise of the device.\n"
msgstr "Sa gabay na ito, pumipili tayo ng bias tolerance na 5%. Tandaan na nakabatay ang kalkulasyon ng bias na ito sa natutunang noise model, na maaaring hindi lubos na tugma sa totoong noise ng device.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare a PEC + SLC program, execute the program, and post-process {#prepare-a-pec--slc-program-execute-the-program-and-post-process}"
msgstr "Maghanda ng PEC + SLC program, patakbuhin ang programa, at mag-post-process {#prepare-a-pec--slc-program-execute-the-program-and-post-process}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the local scales chosen, we can build the full PEC+SLC execution program. The `PEC.prepare` call constructs a `QuantumProgram` that encodes the anti-noise injection strategy into the circuit's box annotations. Passing `noise_gain=\"slc_local_scales\"` instructs the executor to use the per-error weights set by `set_slc_local_scales`, rather than applying the same full inverse-noise gain to every error as vanilla PEC would.\n"
msgstr "Kapag napili na ang mga local scale, maaari na nating buuin ang buong PEC+SLC execution program. Bumubuo ang tawag na `PEC.prepare` ng `QuantumProgram` na nag-e-encode ng anti-noise injection strategy sa mga box annotation ng circuit. Ang pagpasa ng `noise_gain=\"slc_local_scales\"` ay nag-uutos sa executor na gamitin ang mga bigat bawat error na itinakda ng `set_slc_local_scales`, sa halip na ilapat ang parehong buong inverse-noise gain sa bawat error gaya ng gagawin ng vanilla PEC.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To produce a fair comparison, a second `PEC` task is prepared with `noise_gain=0`, which corresponds to full PEC cancellation with no SLC bias allowance. Both programs are added to the same `QuantumProgram` so they share a single execution job — their circuits are interleaved and executed together, meaning any hardware drift affects both equally.\n"
msgstr "Para makagawa ng patas na paghahambing, naghahanda ng pangalawang `PEC` task na may `noise_gain=0`, na tumutugma sa buong PEC cancellation nang walang SLC bias allowance. Idinaragdag ang dalawang programa sa iisang `QuantumProgram` para iisang execution job ang pagbabahagian nila — pinagsasalitan at sabay na pinapatakbo ang mga circuit nila, kaya parehong naaapektuhan ang dalawa ng anumang hardware drift.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the job completes, `postprocess` converts the raw measurement bitstrings into expectation values, applying the appropriate PEC rescaling factor γ for each task.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos makumpleto ang job, kino-convert ng `postprocess` ang mga raw na measurement bitstring sa mga expectation value, na inilalapat ang angkop na PEC rescaling factor na γ para sa bawat task.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the mitigated expectation values and shot overhead {#compare-the-mitigated-expectation-values-and-shot-overhead}"
msgstr "Ihambing ang mga mitigated na expectation value at shot overhead {#compare-the-mitigated-expectation-values-and-shot-overhead}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The ideal expectation value of the mirrored circuit is 1 by construction, so the bias of any estimate is simply `|1 - result|`. This final cell prints the bias and total shot count for three scenarios side-by-side:\n"
msgstr "Ang ideal na expectation value ng mirrored na circuit ay 1 sa konstruksyon, kaya ang bias ng anumang tantiya ay simpleng `|1 - result|`. Inililimbag ng huling cell na ito ang bias at kabuuang bilang ng shot para sa tatlong senaryo nang magkakatabi:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Unmitigated**: the raw noisy expectation value with no error cancellation applied.\n"
msgstr "**Unmitigated**: ang raw na noisy na expectation value na walang inilapat na error cancellation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Full PEC**: zero-bias error cancellation using the complete inverse noise model on every layer, at the full γ² sampling overhead.\n"
msgstr "**Full PEC**: zero-bias na error cancellation gamit ang kumpletong inverse noise model sa bawat layer, sa buong γ² na sampling overhead.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**PEC+SLC**: error cancellation guided by the shaded-lightcone local scales, tolerating the chosen `bias_tolerance` in exchange for a substantially lower shot count.\n"
msgstr "**PEC+SLC**: error cancellation na ginagabayan ng mga local scale ng shaded-lightcone, na tumatanggap ng napiling `bias_tolerance` kapalit ng mas mababang bilang ng shot.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Comparing the three rows shows the concrete benefit of SLC: the mitigated bias of PEC+SLC stays well below the unmitigated bias while the total number of shots is significantly smaller than what full PEC required.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng paghahambing ng tatlong hanay ang konkretong benepisyo ng SLC: ang mitigated na bias ng PEC+SLC ay nananatiling mas mababa nang malayo sa unmitigated na bias habang mas maliit nang husto ang kabuuang bilang ng shot kaysa sa kinailangan ng buong PEC.\n"
